    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 375,000\n\nThis newly upgraded home on Upper John Street will give a new owner years of enjoyment, in a fantastic town location, with nothing to do but move in and enjoy.\nThe property comes to the market with a B BER Rate and is presented to the market in turn-key condition throughout.\nOn the ground floor is a living room that opens directly into the kitchen/dining area. The stylish kitchen offers ample storage with a large island return. There is a downstairs bedroom (which could of course be used for whatever other accommodation you need) and the shower room can be accessed from this room or from the hallway. \nTo the back of the ground floor is the rear lobby with hot press, understair storage and access to the rear garden. Upstairs are three double bedrooms and shower room. The main bedroom has an en-suite and large ante-room which could be used as a wardrobe, gym, study/office or just storage.\nIf you are looking for something in a central location that will be low maintenance (both inside and out) for years to come, No. 35 offers you just that.\nOFCH, mains services, south facing to the front, small enclosed rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.4m x 0.9m\nwith tiled steps (2) from street level. Timber effect flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 3.3m\nwith recessed front facing window, opens into the kitchen. Wiring for electric fire installed\n\nKitchen/Dining - 4.6m x 3.9m\ndouble aspect room with recessed front facing window and window overlooking the back garden, island return 2.4m x 0.9m, waist and eye level units. Fitted: induction hob, extractor, integrated dishwasher. Provision made for integrated fridge freezer and oven/microwave\n\nGuest Shower Room - 3.5m x 1.8m\nwith WC, WHB in floating vanity unit, mains shower with rainwater head, LED mirror, heated towel rail.Jack and Jill into bedroom\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.4m x 3m\nwith recessed front facing window. Jack and Jill access to shower room\n\nRear Lobby - 3.2m x 2.3m\nwith understair storage and hot press/plant room. Glazed rear door and rear window.\n\nLanding Return - 2.4m x 0.9m\nskylight overhead\n\nLanding - 1.4m x 1.3m and 4m x 1.7m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nStorage Area - 2.4m x 0.9m\nto the rear of the landing\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.1m x 3.4m\nfront facing window, carpet, attic hatch (no storage). Measurement includes en-suite area\n\nEn-Suite - 2.7m x 1.7m\nWC, WHB in floating vanity, shower with rainwater head, LED mirror, heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 3 - 4m x 3.1m\nwith front-facing window, carpet flooring\n\nLobby - 1.7m x 1.1m\nwith carpet flooring - leads to main bedroom\n\nBedroom 4 - 4m x 3.1m\nwith carpet flooring, recessed front facing window and anteroom\n\nAnteroom off Bedroom 4 - 5.1m x 3.1m\nwith carpet flooring - perfect for many uses including home office, walk in wardrobe or gym\n\nBathroom - 3.1m x 1.8m\nrear facing recessed window, WC, WHB in floating vanity unit, electric shower, heated towel rail, LED mirror\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>144sqm mid-terraced home</li><li>Fantastic town location</li><li>Living area into kitchen/dining to the front</li><li>Fitted kitchen with some appliances</li><li>Downstairs bedroom with en-suite</li><li>Three bedrooms upstairs, two shower rooms</li><li>Newly upgraded with BER B rating</li><li>Beautifully finished throughout</li><li>Wood effect flooring (Grizzly SPC Max) in living areas</ul>"
